   "id": "p01",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "The storm came in the night and pulled at everything. In the morning the forest was full of fallen branches, and one of them held a nest.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dawn",
    "weather": "rain",
