    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-08/p02.mp3",
   "durationSec": 7.25,
   "srcHash": "cecaeba123271d7b8492228c0a7b193fa2605cba"
  },
  {
   "id": "p03",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "He picked up the last egg. His hands were metal and his fingers did not know how to be gentle, so he learned it right there, in about four seconds.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "sitting"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "nest",
      "pos": "left",
      "size": "small"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-08/p03.mp3",
   "durationSec": 9.79,
   "srcHash": "df747304a3f9dc3cf7c0c105d738fc0e5c5d2abd"
  },
  {
   "id": "p04",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "He carried the nest back to his fire and set it down where the warmth reached but did not burn. Then he sat with it, all day, doing nothing else.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "sitting"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "fire",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "medium"
     },
     {
      "kind": "nest",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "small"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "nest",
      "rel": "next to",
      "object": "fire"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-08/p04.mp3",
   "durationSec": 9.77,
   "srcHash": "42cf45a171c94589825223565c256ba2b8073639"
  },
  {
   "id": "p05",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "On the third day the egg moved. Then it opened, and a small wet grey thing came out and looked straight at him with one eye.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "goose",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "sitting"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "nest",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "medium"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
